{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1455153-exalted-essence-charm-for-creating-custom-spirits-peach","id":1455153,"title":"Exalted Essence Charm for Creating Custom Spirits (PEACH)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-07-18T18:55:27-07:00","id":1455153,"title":"Exalted Essence Charm for Creating Custom Spirits (PEACH)","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">I really wanted to see this in XS, and, when it wasn't available, tried my best to create my own. It's supposed to be balanced against the Summoning rules, erring on the side of mechanically weaker since creating a new spirit has such cool narrative potential. This is very much a rough draft.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br /> Spirit-Birthing Hand</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Prerequisite:</b> Sagacity 5, Essence 2</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">The Exalt may undertake a special venture to create an entirely new spirit. Its statistics are determined by its Essence, which is normally 1. Choose one area of focus or two highly specialized ones for its Primary pool, and one or two areas for its Secondary Pool. The spirit may be created with powerful Qualities by adding an obstacle to the venture of suitable difficulty.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">The created spirt serves the Exalt loyally, counting as a three-dot Familiar. Before creating another spirit with this charm, the Exalt must either allow her existing one to dissipate into Creation\u2019s essence or free it to act independently by spending a Personal Milestone.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Create Spirit Venture</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Prerequisites: None</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Time Scale: One scene</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Base Obstacles: 3</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Common obstacles:</b> Something from Nothing (Difficulty 5), Prepare Setting (Difficulty 4), Draw Creation\u2019s Essence (Difficulty 4), Draw Yu-Shan\u2019s/the Underworld\u2019s/Malfeas\u2019s/Autochtonia\u2019s Essence (Difficulty 5), Draw the Wyld\u2019s/Zen-Mu\u2019s Essence (Difficulty 6), Nurture Inner Resonance (Difficulty 5), Visualize a New Entity (Difficulty 3)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Common advantages:</b> Additional soak (2 successes, maximum 3), Additional health levels (1 success, maximum 4), Additional minor Quality (4 successes, maximum 3)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Common consequences: </b>spirit has flaw which works against its intended purpose; spirit has a negative Intimacy towards its creator or her allies; energy of creation released as minor harmful spirit or dangerous phenomenon</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Created Spirit</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Primary Pool 8 + (Essence)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Secondary Pool 5 + (Essence)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Tertiary Pool 3 + (Essence)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Resolve</b>: 2 + (Essence/2, round up)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Health Levels</b>: 5 + (Essence/2, round up)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Defense</b>: 5</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Hardness</b>: 2 + (Essence)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Soak</b>: 3</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Death-Shaping Artistry (Abyssal):</b> The Exalt may use this Charm to create a ghost from someone who has just died, will soon die, or dies as part of the Venture. If she does, its Essence is equal to her own.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Dragon\u2019s Egg Hatched (Dragon-Blooded): </b>The Exalt may create an Elemental spirit. It gets one free Quality reflecting its elemental nature.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Nascent Soul Hierarchy (Infernal):</b> The Exalt creates a demon out of a part of her own twisted mind. Its Essence is equal to her own, and it gets a free Quality reflecting its unnatural urges or disposition.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Moon-In-Well Emanation (Lunar):</b> The Exalt creates a spirit out of her own reflection, which looks identical to her, has her Essence minus 1, and may use her dice pools instead of its own. Such a spirit cannot be freed, only absorbed into herself.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Ephemeral Induction Technique (Solar):</b> The Exalt may create any type of Spirit, or a Fair Folk. Its Essence is equal to her own.</span></span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25834-habitableexoplanet","name":"habitableexoplanet","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"296"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}